      "id": "remove-user-defined-attribute",
      "name": "RemoveUserDefinedAttribute",
      "category": "Interchange ",
      "signature": "RemoveUserDefinedAttribute(Interchange Node, User Defined Attribute Name)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Interchange Node",
          "type": "UInterchangeBaseNode*"
        },
        {
          "name": "User Defined Attribute Name",
          "type": "String&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Remove the specified user-defined attribute.\n@param UserDefinedAttributeName - The name of the user-defined attribute to remove.\n@return - True if the attribute exists and was removed, or if the attribute doesn't exist. Returns false if the attribute exists but could not be removed.\nNote - User-defined attributes are the user custom attributes from the DCC translated node (for example, extra attributes in Maya).\nThe payload key points to an FRichCurve payload."
    },
